r, more immediate V8 exhaust character. They are available with \u003cstrong\u003e200-cell high-flow sport catalysts\u003c\/strong\u003e or as a \u003cstrong\u003ecatless configuration\u003c\/strong\u003e for maximum exhaust flow.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eChoose the Correct Downpipe Configuration\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e200-cell catted downpipes:\u003c\/strong\u003e high-flow catalyst configuration developed for customers who want improved flow while retaining catalytic converters\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCatless downpipes:\u003c\/strong\u003e unrestricted race configuration intended for off-road or motorsport use where permitted\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003ePerformance and Sound\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eReplacing the restrictive factory downpipe section can improve exhaust-gas flow and significantly increase sound intensity. The effect is strongest when the downpipes are combined with the \u003ca href=\"\/products\/ipe-valvetronic-exhaust-lamborghini-urus-se\"\u003eiPE Valvetronic exhaust system for the Lamborghini Urus SE\u003c\/a\u003e. The final result depends on the selected front pipe, rear exhaust, valve position and engine calibration.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eKey Benefits\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVehicle-specific development for the Lamborghini Urus SE\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChoice of catted or catless construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e200-cell high-flow catalysts in the catted version\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eReduced exhaust restriction compared with the corresponding factory section\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMore aggressive turbo-V8 sound and improved exhaust response\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCan be configured with the iPE OPF front pipe and Valvetronic muffler system\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eFitment and Compatibility\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor the \u003cstrong\u003e