rrari FF in\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e Titanium\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eValve control:\u003c\/strong\u003e Supported on selected IPE Valvetronic applications\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eConfiguration:\u003c\/strong\u003e Vehicle-specific; exact contents depend on application and selected options\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\n\u003ch3\u003eWhat Is Included?\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis listing is for an IPE exhaust system for this vehicle. Depending on the application, the configuration may include rear mufflers, valve sections, link pipes, downpipes, headers, tips, control modules or related installation hardware. Exact contents can differ per model and selected option.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003ch3\u003eMaterial and Construction\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis configuration is listed as \u003cstrong\u003etitanium\u003c\/strong\u003e. Titanium is commonly selected for high-end exhaust applications because it offers a lower weight than stainless steel, a premium motorsport feel and a sharper, more technical sound character where the vehicle and system design allow it.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003ch3\u003eSound and Driving Experience\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor Ferrari applications, IPE focuses on creating a more emotional and exotic exhaust character, adding presence and intensity while keeping the car usable when the valves are closed. With the valves closed, supported IPE systems are designed to stay more refined for normal driving. With the valves open, the system delivers the more aggressive, emotional and performance-focused sound character IPE is known for.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003ch3\u003eKey Benefits\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003eVehicle-specific IPE Exhaust System for the Ferrari FF in\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003eTitanium configuration as listed\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003eDesigned for a more emotional, performance-oriented exhaust sound\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003eValve-controlled sound character on supported IPE Valvetronic applications\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003eImproved exhaust flow and reduced restriction compared with selected factory components\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003eOfficial IPE distributor support, availability checks and worldwide shipping by BaanVelgen\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\n\u003ch3\u003eFitment and Compatibility\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis IPE product is intended for the \u003cstrong\u003eFerrari FF in\u003c\/strong\u003e. Before ordering, confirm model year, engine version, market specification, OPF\/GPF setup, catalyst configuration and installation requirements. Exhaust compatibility can vary between EU, UK, US and other market vehicles.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003ch3\u003eWhy Order IPE from BaanVelgen?\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBaanVelgen is an official IPE Exhaust distributor in Europe, supplying IPE exhaust systems, mufflers, link pipes, downpipes, headers and related components to private customers, workshops, dealers and professional builders worldwide. We assist with product selection, fitment checks, pricing, availability and international shipping.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003ch3\u003eNeed Help Choosing the Right IPE Setup?\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf you are unsure which IPE configuration fits your car, contact BaanVelgen with your vehicle model, model year and engine specification. We can help confirm the correct exhaust setup before you order.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003ch3\u003eFrequently Asked Questions\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eIs this IPE product compatible with my car?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCompatibility depends on exact model, production year, engine, OPF\/GPF specification and market version. Contact BaanVelgen before ordering if you are unsure.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eIs this IPE exhaust valve-controlled?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMany IPE systems are part of the Valvetronic range, but valve operation depends on the specific product and vehicle application. BaanVelgen can confirm the correct setup before purchase.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eIs this product road legal?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStreet legality depends on the vehicle, country, catalyst configuration and local regulations. Always check local regulations before installation, especially for catless, downpipe, link pipe, cat bypass and header configurations.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eCan BaanVelgen ship this IPE product worldwide?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYes. BaanVelgen supplies IPE products to private customers, workshops and dealers worldwide.\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2022-11-23T20:01:50+01:00","created_at":"2022-11-23T20:01:50+01:00","updated_at":"2026-10-14T13:55:14+02:00","vendor":"iPE Exhaust","product_type":"Exhaust","tags":["__label:Free Shipping","IPE F1 exhaust","Shop by vehicle"],"variants":[{"id":41363264667853,"title":"No, thanks \/ Chrome Polished (standard)","option1":"No, thanks","option2":"Chrome Polished (standard)","option3":null,"sku":"ipe-exhaust-uitlaat-titanium-full-ferrari-ff-innotech","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"10683.01","grams":0,"compare_at_price":null,"position":1,"product_id":7125312995533,"created_at":"2022-11-23T20:01:50+01:00","updated_at":"2026-10-14T13:55:14+02:00"},{"id":41363264700621,"title":"No, thanks \/ Titanium Blue","option1":"No, thanks","option2":"Titanium Blue","option3":null,"sku":"ipe-exhaust-uitlaat-titanium-full-ferrari-ff-innotech","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"10846.00","grams":0,"compare_at_price":null,"position":2,"product_id":7125312995533,"created_at":"2022-11-23T20:01:50+01:00","updated_at":"2026-10-14T13:55:14+02:00"},{"id":41363264733389,"title":"No, thanks \/ Titanium Gold","option1":"No, thanks","option2":"Titanium Gold","option3":null,"sku":"ipe-exhaust-uitlaat-titanium-full-